{%- style -%}

.fc-about {
  width: 100%;
  padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px);
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

#MainContent .fc-about-statement {
  font-family: var(--fc-font);
  font-size: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 26px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--fc-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.55;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  max-width: min(680px, 90vw);
  width: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  text-align: left;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

#MainContent .fc-about-tagline {
  font-family: var(--fc-font);
  font-size: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 26px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  line-height: 1.55;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  max-width: min(680px, 90vw);
  width: 100%;
  margin: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px) 0 0;
  text-align: left;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
  #MainContent .fc-about-statement,
  #MainContent .fc-about-tagline {
    font-size: 16px;
  }
}

{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="fc-about">

  <p class="fc-about-statement" lang="en">Finecoustic is an audio brand focused on products that balance listening experience, visual appeal, and everyday use. We believe audio products are more than functional devices&mdash;they are part of the spaces we live in and the routines we experience every day. Designed for people who value both sound and aesthetics, Finecoustic approaches audio with attention to how products look, feel, and sound in different environments.</p>

  <p class="fc-about-tagline" lang="en">Built to be Seen. Meant to be Heard.</p>

</div>

